#: includes/abilities/funnels/edit-flow.php:58
msgid "Where to put the steps. Exactly one of: {\"after\": step}, {\"before\": step}, {\"branch_of\": step, \"branch\": key, \"position\": \"start\"|\"end\"} for a branch of an if_else (\"yes\"/\"no\") or the steps that only run after a benchmark (\"then\"), or {\"branch\": \"main\", \"position\": \"start\"|\"end\"}."
